# Push a change to this file to run a backtest without the GitHub connector.
# Format: one line, "MODE [MONTHS]". Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The mode must also be in the fetch-step whitelist in backtest.yml, or it will
# silently get the short-history fetcher (see the v78bt note in CLAUDE.md).
#
# v81bt re-run after the FIX. Run 1 of v81bt found it: shared/strategy.ts booked
# a stop exit at the MARK it was handed, which in a backtest is the bar's worst
# price — so stop-outs showed -5R to -10R on trades whose stop caps them at -1R.
# 99.4% of 11,412 trades disagreed. Stops now fill at the STOP LEVEL.
# Expect ladder B to converge on ladder A (+0.052 net) if that was the whole gap.
v81bt 36
